Task 3 - Project Objectives
General Objective
To design and develop a secure, user-friendly web and mobile Laundry Booking and Management System, supported by a normalized relational database, that automates laundry booking, order processing, payment recording, and order tracking, thereby improving the service quality, accuracy, and operational efficiency of a laundry business.
Specific Objectives
•	To analyze the existing manual booking and order process and define the functional and non-functional requirements of the proposed system.
•	To design the system using appropriate architecture and modeling tools, and a normalized relational database with an Entity-Relationship Diagram (ERD), data dictionary, and defined constraints.
•	To develop a RESTful API with authentication, role-based authorization, input validation, and error handling that connects the web interface, the mobile application, and the database.
•	To develop responsive web and mobile interfaces that let customers register, book services, schedule a drop-off time, receive notifications, and track orders, and let staff and administrators manage orders, services, payments, and reports.
•	To incorporate emerging technologies such as QR-code order tagging, push or email notifications, and a sandbox digital payment gateway.
•	To test, secure, and deploy the system, and prepare complete documentation, including testing results, a deployment guide, and a user manual.
